        "Description": "Our customer is a security company whose contract was not renewed when it ended. The consulate hired cheaper guards. Prove that they are not up to the task. Infiltrate the consulate under the guise and merge with the office workers, then eliminate three of them. And at the same time, steal a car from the parking lot - this is the car of the employer, which he left there.\r\rIf you need more poison - according to my information, one vial should be in the armory between the school and the consulate",
